      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, this is a good start. but honestly, it feels a bit heavy on the 'social harmony' side of things. do you think you missed any of the more traditional or individual-focused virtues? like personal responsibility, discipline, or even something like courage? some people might say those are actually more vital for a democracy to stay strong.",
